input/output or conditioning, leading to a thin_abstract_boundary.","The abstract describes fine-tuning GPT-2, a generative LLM, for cell generation and text generation tasks in single-cell biology, clearly meeting generative and foundation-model criteria.","Paper presents Cell2Sentence fine-tuning GPT-2 on cell sentences. Text component and text-bio bridge are unclear because 'cell sentences' are biological token sequences, not natural-language text; text generation mention is ambiguous. Generative model is clear from cell generation and GPT-2 fine-tuning.",Cell2Sentence: teaching large language models the language of biology,"Abstract
