t. Therefore, the candidate model lacks a substantive text/language component.","The paper fine-tunes an existing generative model (GPT-2) for biological tasks, making it an application wrapper rather than a new foundational model.","The abstract presents Cell2Sentence as a method to adapt LLMs to single-cell transcriptomics using cell sentences (biological tokens), not natural-language text. While the model is generative and uses GPT-2, the text component is not clearly natural language, so text_component_present=no and text_bio_bridge_present=no, leading to exclusion EC2_no_text_component. The paper is a primary model paper, not a wrapper, because it introduces a fine-tuning method.",Cell2Sentence: teaching large language models the language of biology,"Abstract
