ndation model for single-cell epigenomics using cell sentences (biological tokens) and does not involve natural-language text or text-bio alignment. | EpiAgent uses bidirectional attention (encoder-only) for representation learning; tasks are predictive/classification/imputation, not generative. No decoder, autoregressive, diffusion, or generation mechanism described.",EpiAgent is a foundation model for single-cell epigenomics using cell sentences (biological tokens) and does not involve natural-language text or text-bio alignment.,"EpiAgent uses bidirectional attention (encoder-only) for representation learning; tasks are predictive/classification/imputation, not generative. No decoder, autoregressive, diffusion, or generation mechanism described.",,EpiAgent: foundation model for single-cell epigenomics,"Abstract
