ndation model for single-cell epigenomics using 'cell sentences' which are biological tokens, not natural language text; no text component or text-bio bridge described. | The abstract describes an encoder-only bidirectional attention model for single-cell epigenomics; no generative mechanism (decoder, autoregressive, diffusion, or generation of text/sequences) is mentioned.","EpiAgent is a foundation model for single-cell epigenomics using 'cell sentences' which are biological tokens, not natural language text; no text component or text-bio bridge described.","The abstract describes an encoder-only bidirectional attention model for single-cell epigenomics; no generative mechanism (decoder, autoregressive, diffusion, or generation of text/sequences) is mentioned.",,EpiAgent: foundation model for single-cell epigenomics,"Abstract
