_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract describes an evaluation and ablation study of existing single-cell RNA foundation models against baselines. It does not present a new generative text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"we explore two foundation models recently developed for single-cell RNA sequencing data\" and \"compare[d] to a simple baseline\""},{"record_id":"rec_002552","paper_type":"benchmark_resource","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"benchmark_resource","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This paper systematically evaluates rare-cell detection tools and analytical strategies on scRNA-seq datasets. It is a benchmarking study, not a candidate model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"We performed a comprehensive benchmarking analysis of five widely used rare cell detection tools\""}]}
