","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"SubCell is a self-supervised vision foundation model for fluorescence microscopy. The abstract centers on image-based cellular biology and does not describe a text or language component.","evidence_snippet":"\"proteome-aware vision foundation models for microscopy\"; \"trained on the proteome-wide image collection\""},{"record_id":"rec_000093","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"SpaGene is a deep learning framework for integrating scRNA-seq and spatial transcriptomics to impute missing genes. The abstract contains biological modalities only, with no substantive text component.","evidence_snippet":"\"integrate scRNA-seq data and spatial transcriptomics data\"; \"impute missing gene expressions\""},{"record_id":"rec_000094","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_substantive_text_bio_bridge","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"PST is presented as a protein-based genome language model trained on viral datasets. The abstract supports a biological language-model style component, but it does not show a substantive text-bio bridge.","evidence_snippet":"\"protein-based genome language model\"; \"models genomes as sets of proteins\""},{"record_id":"rec_000095","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract describes a vision transformer for MRI classification and only mentions single-cell RNA and multimodal pipelines as future directions. There is no substantive text/language component in the candidate model.","evidence_snippet":"\"DSViT made to find and locate brain tumors\"; \"Future directions include extending DSViT into multimodal pipelines\""},{"record_id":"rec_000096","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"unclear","text_bio_bridge_present":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is explicitly a review of AI in antibody-drug conjugate development, not a primary model paper. It surveys multiple AI methods across the ADC pipeline rather than proposing a new text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"This review outlines how AI empowers each stage of the ADC pipeline\""}]}
