168","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"MMF-SV is a structural variant caller using alignment signals and textual features extracted from alignment information. The abstract does not show a substantive natural-language or generative text-bio bridge.","evidence_snippet":"\"integrates matching patterns and statistical information from CIGAR signals with textual features extracted from alignment information\""}]}
